FINDINGS:
1. [MAJOR] src/analyzer.rs:311 — `Statement::RepeatUntil` destructures `body, condition, ..`, discarding `condition_span`, then reports the condition with `self.analyze_expr(condition, &span)` where `span` is the `repeat` line — why it matters is an analyzer failure in the condition (e.g. `repeat / set t to 1 / until q is 1`) names the `repeat` line instead of the `until` line, losing the line the phase added `condition_span` to preserve and diverging from `src/interpreter.rs:1289` and `src/bytecode/codegen.rs:413` which both use it — concrete fix is bind `condition_span` and call `self.analyze_expr(condition, condition_span)`.
REVIEW VERDICT: FINDINGS 1
